      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MANILA SUN (2) claimed her maiden two back when strongly fancied to break through then third last time, beaten 2.75 lengths (26.19) at Temora over 457m. Returns to the scene of her maiden win. Good run latest and can go on with it. CAWBOURNE MASON (1) is better than last start when fifth (23.65) from Box 5 at this track over 400m. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Can measure up this time. IVORY NARA (7) is a patchy beginner. Last start finished 4th over 320m at this track beaten 6 lengths (18.64) behind Let's Go Jill in a Grade 5 on August 28. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. HOUSE MONEY (4) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
